{"type": "message", "id": "60ed5fcf", "parentId": "20471755", "timestamp": "2026-04-16T16:03:58.618Z", "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "Excellent! I found key data:\n\nFrom the Florida DOE PDF search result:\n- Kentucky NAEP 2022 grade 8 math score: 269 (NOT 270 - it's below 270!)\n- Nevada: 269\n- South Carolina: 269\n- Maryland: 269\n- Arkansas: 267\n\nWait, the summary said Kentucky had 270, but the search result shows Kentucky at 269. Let me re-verify this.\n\nAlso, the 2024 Kansas snapshot report shows:\n- Kansas NAEP 2022 grade 8 math score: 272 (confirmed!)\n\nSo if Kentucky is 269 (below 270), then Kentucky does NOT qualify on the NAEP criterion.\n\nNow I need to verify:\n1. Arizona's NAEP 2022 grade 8 math score\n2. FRED median listing prices for January 2023\n\nLet me search for the exact Arizona NAEP score and the FRED housing data.", "thinkingSignature": "reasoning_content"}, {"type": "text", "text": "I found critical NAEP data! From the Florida DOE PDF:\n- Kentucky: 269 (below 270 - does NOT qualify)\n- South Carolina: 269 (below 270 - does NOT qualify)\n- Kansas: 272 (confirmed from 2024 snapshot - above 270 - QUALIFIES on NAEP criterion)\n\nLet me verify Arizona's NAEP score and find the FRED housing prices:"}, {"type": "toolCall", "id": "tool-b1291efe35c5495bb5e1b3c737ffb9f0", "name": "web_fetch", "arguments": {"url": "https://nces.ed.gov/nationsreportcard/subject/publications/stt2024/pdf/2024219AZ8.pdf"}}, {"type": "toolCall", "id": "tool-033df3efb4a945b49f9cf3f3298b38af", "name": "web_search", "arguments": {"query": "\"median listing price\" \"January 2023\" Kentucky $285 $290 $295 thousand FRED state"}}, {"type": "toolCall", "id": "tool-c0fd746d34f848e7900202540aad505c", "name": "web_search", "arguments": {"query": "Kansas median listing price January 2023 FRED MEDLISPRIKS value 280000 290000 300000"}}], "api": "openai-completions", "provider": "qwen", "model": "glm-5", "usage": {"input": 4086, "output": 596, "cacheRead": 56511, "cacheWrite": 0, "totalTokens": 61193, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "stopReason": "toolUse", "timestamp": 1776355421522, "responseId": "chatcmpl-a94723bd-3437-99ba-9ced-604eb85ff6b8"}}
